    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join us on discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Pacific Life is a first-person game where you start with only a few tools in a small village. What happens next is all yours!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476130/extras/93145496858987d10192761f4c14d9b6.webp?t=1667295134\" /></div><br><br>Stat your new life on <strong>Pacific Island</strong>!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Design your own voxel objects<br></li><li> Gather ressources to build them or trade<br></li><li> Hire bots to make the hard work for you<br></li><li> Manage your empire and make Pacific Island great again!</li></ul><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476130/extras/91a68d5ad847e262687c0983d737a854.webp?t=1667295134\" /></div><br><br>A whole 4km\u00b2 Island for you to explore, gather, and to build on!<br>Until.. you get a way to reach more lands? <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476130/extras/5b16f8e6b3f96a55f53a273d32114fce.webp?t=1667295134\" /></div><br><br>Design your own objects and buidling using our simple to use voxel-based object editor!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476130/extras/3d290e87e5fcff47c8c54b938c54a61f.webp?t=1667295134\" /></div><br><br>Go gather some ressources, you will need them to build, or make money out of it! <br>But be careful, some of them, will never come back!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476130/extras/b060b6d4312e68302efe60f5f35115be.poster.avif?t=1667295134\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476130/extras/b060b6d4312e68302efe60f5f35115be.webm?t=1667295134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476130/extras/b060b6d4312e68302efe60f5f35115be.mp4?t=1667295134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476130/extras/77fd6dbab2ea6ea6015dfa6968ad1292.webp?t=1667295134\" /></div><br><br>Build the objects you designed using the precious ressources you gathered and expand your lands!<br><br><br><strong>So join Pacific Life now and start your new adventure!</strong>",
